    echr:hasSupportingQuote "Under section 39/67 of the Aliens Act, an appeal on points of law against the decisions of the Aliens Appeals Board lies to the Conseil d’État ."^^xsd:string,
        "the general assembly of the Aliens Appeals Board on 8 December 2016"^^xsd:string .

